@page "/docs/primitives/select"

<DocsPage Title="Select" Description="A common form component for choosing a predefined value in a dropdown menu.">
    <ComponentPreview Name="primitives/select-hero" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Usage guidelines" />
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Prefer Combobox for large lists:</strong> Select isn't filterable, apart from keyboard typeahead to find and highlight items. Prefer <a href="/docs/primitives/combobox">Combobox</a> when there are enough items to warrant filtering.</li>
        <li><strong>Special positioning behavior:</strong> By default the popup overlaps its trigger, so the selected item's text lines up with the trigger's value. Turn it off with <code>AlignItemWithTrigger</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Form controls must have an accessible name:</strong> Prefer <code>SelectLabel</code>, or give <code>SelectTrigger</code> an <code>aria-label</code> when no visible label is rendered.</li>
        <li><strong>Closing animations:</strong> The popup stays rendered until its closing animation finishes. See <a href="/docs/primitives/animation">Animation</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <DocsHeading Title="Anatomy" />
    <p>Import the primitives and assemble the parts:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@Anatomy" />
    <DocsHeading Title="API Reference" />
    <PartReference Type="typeof(SelectRoot)" />
    <PartReference Type="typeof(SelectTrigger)">
        <DataAttributes>
            <StyleHook Name="data-popup-open">Present when the corresponding select is open.</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-pressed">Present when the trigger is pressed.</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-disabled">Present when the select is disabled.</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-readonly">Present when the select is readonly.</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-required">Present when the select is required.</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-valid">Present when the select is in a valid state (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-invalid">Present when the select is in an invalid state (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-dirty">Present when the select's value has changed (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-touched">Present when the select has been touched (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-filled">Present when the select has a value (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-focused">Present when the select trigger is focused (when wrapped in FieldRoot).</StyleHook>
            <StyleHook Name="data-placeholder">Present when the select doesn't have a value.</StyleHook>
        </DataAttributes>
    </PartReference>
    <PartReference Type="typeof(SelectValue)">
        <DataAttributes>
            <StyleHook Name="data-placeholder">Present when the select doesn't have a value.</StyleHook>
        </DataAttributes>
    </PartReference>
    <PartReference Type="typeof(SelectIcon)">
